	(footprint "MYMGK00506ERSR_AE"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "8487ea81-4eaa-4037-abd8-d0c8ba6f73ab")
		(at 24 70)
		(descr "Akizuki AE-MYMGK00506ERSR-5V0 : Murata MYMGK00506ERSR 5V/6A step-down module (K-15108). Plug-in daughterboard on 2x 1x6 female headers (CN1 left / CN2 right), columns 25.4mm apart, 2.54mm pitch, board 28.5x16mm, Vin DC8-15V(typ12) -> Vout 5V fixed, eff ~95%. Carrier lands (THT sockets), viewed from component (top) side: LEFT column pad1-6 top->bottom = PG/CTRL/GND/GND/VIN/VIN (CN1) ; RIGHT column pad7-12 top->bottom = GND/GND/GND/VOUT/VOUT/VOUT (CN2). PER DATASHEET connect ALL VIN(5,6), ALL VOUT(10,11,12) and ALL GND together - per-pin current rating requires it. PG(1)=open, needs ext pull-up only if used. CTRL(2)=open -> output always ON. Module body overhangs these lands -> treat outline as keepout. Verify plug orientation against real module silk at assembly. Dims/pinout measured from datasheet K-15108 (2020-04-02).")
